	<string name="servicio_nombre">Tiresias</string>
	<string name="servicio_resumen">Screen reader</string>
	<string name="servicio_descripcion">Tiresias reads aloud what is on the screen and lets you control your phone with gestures, the keyboard and braille. To do this it needs to see the screen, receive your gestures and key presses, and act on your behalf. It does not store, log or send anything it reads: it only speaks it. Online artificial intelligence is only used when you ask for it, with your own key.</string>
